261 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (  I flew to Texas to see the total eclipse of April 8, 2024. I chose Texas because it is closest to Arizona, and because in general the weather in the southwest is sunnier than in the midwest or northeast. And I chose Dallas because it was easiest to get to.  I made my flight and hotel reservations way ahead of time, in August 2023, knowing that the prices would go up as we got closer to the event.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [15]
>>
