415 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (  Over 1,000 people gathered in Fountain Hills, Arizona, for a solar eclipse-watching party and groundbreaking ceremony for the International Dark Sky Discovery Center. The center, to be built by McCarthy Building Companies, will span 23,000 square feet and include a planetarium, observatory, exhibit hall, and more. Fountain Hills is the 17th International Dark Sky Community worldwide. The center seeks further donations and offers naming opportunities. For more information or to support the project, visit www.darkskycenter.org.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
416 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Attended by Scott Adams:)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
417 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (  We broke ground today for the International Dark Sky Discovery Center, a developing project in Fountain Hills.  )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [7]
>>
